    "name_raw": "Dreadful Carnage",
    "definition_type_raw": "Combat",
    "source_book_raw": null,
    "definition_raw": "Slaying an enemy demoralizes your other nearby foes.\n\nPrerequisites: Str 15, Power Attack, Furious Focus, base attack bonus +11.\n\nBenefit: Whenever you reduce an enemy to 0 or fewer hit points, you can make an Intimidate check to demoralize all enemies within 30 feet as a free action. Enemies that cannot see both you and the enemy you reduced to 0 or fewer hit points are unaffected.",
